name: Wrathful Joker — spades juice
author: corpus
description: >-
  Wrathful Joker gives +3 Mult per scored Spade. First-shop spades engine: pairs
  with Arrowhead (+50 Chips per Spade) and Blackboard (Spades/Clubs only). Avoid
  The Goad boss (debuffs Spades).
deck: Red
stake: White
must:
  - joker: WrathfulJoker
    antes: [1]
    sources:
      shopItems: [0, 1, 2, 3]
      boosterPacks: [0, 1]
should:
  - joker: Arrowhead
    antes: [1, 2, 3]
    score: 45
  - joker: SmearedJoker
    antes: [1, 2]
    score: 40
  - standardCard:
      suit: Spades
    label: "Any Spade"
    antes: [1, 2]
    score: 15
mustNot:
  - boss: TheGoad
    antes: [1]
